            "review_title": "Review at Bánh Mì Út Thương - Nha Trang",
            "review_text": "David D\n17 contributions\n0\nBest yet, eight days into a 32 day trip.\nJul 2026 • Couples\nSeriously delicious. Totally satisfying. Wonderful young people running the show. My wife made the same noises as me while we ate. Noises that might shame our mothers (joking - they would understand). This was something truly exceptional, especially paired with Saigon beer on ice. She had chicken, I had pork. I will never forget the flavour of the sauce, or the crisp, light freshness of the bread. Am I over-hyping? Perhaps the less you know, the better. If this review turns you off, well and good. The magic stays intact for the uninformed wanderer. More please.\nRead more\nWritten July 18, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
