            "review_text": "Banh Mi Ut Thuong\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam54 contributions\n0\nVery Delicious Bahn Mi\nNov 2024 • Couples\nWe recently decided to go out for breakfast and try some banh mi. We chose this place based on recommendations, and it did not disappoint! The staff immediately impressed us with their politeness and attention to detail. While we waited for our order, we were offered some of their signature bread — a small but pleasant touch.\n\nI especially appreciated that they have a tofu banh mi option — it’s perfect for those who don’t eat meat, and it was absolutely delicious! My husband ordered the Special banh mi, and he loved it too, noting that it was filling and very tasty.\n\nThe atmosphere was made even cozier by a friendly dog that lives in the café. He showed us a few tricks, which added warmth and fun to our visit. The café owner even took some photos of us to remember our time there, and we had a nice chat — she’s very friendly and welcoming.\n\nTo top it all off, there was great music playing in the café, enhancing the atmosphere. We’re sure we’ll be back here again!\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nGrilled Chicken & Grilled Pork\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 9, 2024",
